 not desist, We will surely drag him by the forelock -","readText":"kall\u0101 la`il lam yantahi lanasfa'am bin-n\u0101\u1e63iyah","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/096015.mp3","juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":597,"ruku":538,"hizbQuarter":239,"sajda":false},{"verseId":16,"ayahText":"\u0646\u064e\u0627\u0635\u0650\u064a\u064e\u0629\u064d \u0643\u064e\u0627\u0630\u0650\u0628\u064e\u0629\u064d \u062e\u064e\u0627\u0637\u0650\u0626\u064e\u0629\u064d\u06da","indoText":"yaitu) ubun-ubun orang yang mendustakan dan durhaka.","enText":"A lying, sinning forelock.","readText":"n\u0101\u1e63iyating k\u0101\u017cibatin kh\u0101\u1e6di`ah","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/096016.mp3","juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":597,"ruku":538,"hizbQuarter":239,"sajda":false},{"verseId":17,"ayahText":"\u0641\u064e\u0644\u0652\u064a\u064e\u062f\u0652\u0639\u064f \u0646\u064e\u0627\u062f\u0650\u064a\u064e\u0647\u0657\u06d9","indoText":"Maka biarlah dia memanggil golongannya (untuk menolongnya),","enText":"Then let him call his associates;","readText":"falyad'u n\u0101diyah","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/096017.mp3","juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":597,"ruku":538,"hizbQuarter":239,"sajda":false},{"verseId":18,"ayahText":"\u0633\u064e\u0646\u064e\u062f\u0652\u0639\u064f \u0627\u0644\u0632\u0651\u064e\u0628\u064e\u0627\u0646\u0650\u064a\u064e\u0629\u064e\u06d9","indoText":"Kelak Kami akan memanggil Malaikat Zabaniyah, (penyiksa orang-orang yang berdosa),","enText":"We will call the angels of Hell.","readText":"sanad'uz-zab\u0101niyah","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/096018.mp3","juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":597,"ruku":538,"hizbQuarter":239,"sajda":false},{"verseId":19,"ayahText":"\u0643\u064e\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0627\u06d7 \u0644\u064e\u0627 \u062a\u064f\u0637\u0650\u0639\u0652\u0647\u064f \u0648\u064e\u0627\u0633\u0652\u062c\u064f\u062f\u0652 \u0648\u064e\u0627\u0642\u0652\u062a\u064e\u0631\u0650\u0628\u0652 \u06e9","indoText":"sekali-kali tidak! Janganlah kamu patuh kepadanya; dan sujudlah serta dekatkanlah (dirimu kepada Allah).","enText":"No! Do not obey him. But prostrate and draw near [to Allah].","readText":"kall\u0101, l\u0101 tu\u1e6di'hu wasjud waqtarib","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/096019.mp3","juz":30,"manzil":7,"page":597,"ruku":538,"hizbQuarter":239,"sajda":false}]}";}